{"3684590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Stake", "steam_appid": 3684590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A action game that deeply integrates slot machine random spin mechanics with deckbuilding gameplay. Breaking the fixed combat patterns of traditional skill systems, it takes random probability as the core and deck strategy as the foundation, delivering a one-of-a-kind life-or-death battle experience in every run. There are no rigid combos or fixed routines—only unpredictable skill combinations and high-stakes gambles. Every slot spin marks a desperate wager with your life on the line.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A action game that deeply integrates slot machine random spin mechanics with deckbuilding gameplay. Breaking the fixed combat patterns of traditional skill systems, it takes random probability as the core and deck strategy as the foundation, delivering a one-of-a-kind life-or-death battle experience in every run. There are no rigid combos or fixed routines—only unpredictable skill combinations and high-stakes gambles. Every slot spin marks a desperate wager with your life on the line.</p>", "short_description": "Fast-paced action combining slot rolls and deckbuilding. Every spin unlocks fresh abilities. The battlefield is your table — stake your life and place your Dead Stake！", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/6b602b42f112b84b4b489fc40fa93529ce050cd7/header.jpg?t=1783312112", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/4461a88ec11d361db3560bdc32f659b36c474f77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783312112", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/4461a88ec11d361db3560bdc32f659b36c474f77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783312112",